--- !u!114 &548156470
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 548156356}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 103
  indentLevel: 0
  text: "Bueno, una partidita de vez en cuando no hace da\xF1o a nadie. Al fin y
    al cabo, somos humanos y todos buscamos alguna actividad l\xFAdica de vez en
    cuando \xBFno? "
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 548156484}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
--- !u!114 &548156471
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 548156356}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 102
  indentLevel: 0
  text: "Entiendo. Lo m\xE1s importante en estos casos es ser consciente de nuestra
    situaci\xF3n para poder actuar y mejorar. "
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 548156487}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
--- !u!114 &548156472
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 548156356}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 101
  indentLevel: 0
  text: "Te entiendo. No te preocupes, estoy aqu\xED para ayudarte. Has hecho bien
    llamando por tel\xE9fono, es un gran paso. \xBFPuedo preguntarte m\xE1s acerca
    del tema? \xBFSobre c\xF3mo empezaste a apostar?"
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 548156488}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
--- !u!114 &548156473
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 548156356}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 98
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Estaba pasando por una \xE9poca bastante complicada en mi vida. Acababa
    de independizarme con mi pareja y nuestra situaci\xF3n econ\xF3mica era complicada,
    nos costaba llegar a fin de mes. A ese estr\xE9s se le sum\xF3 la noticia de
    que \xEDbamos a ser padres. "
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1157908968}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
