--- !u!114 &1764620545
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1764620155}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 834
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "\xBFQuieres que hablemos un poco m\xE1s de c\xF3mo te sientes?"
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 1607360311}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1764620546
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1764620155}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 833
  indentLevel: 0
  text: "Creo que no deber\xEDas hablar as\xED de tus padres. Todo el mundo puede
    atravesar malos momentos en su vida que le lleve por caminos indeseados, es algo
    normal que muchas veces escapa de nuestro control."
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 1764620519}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
--- !u!114 &1764620547
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1764620155}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 832
  indentLevel: 0
  text: "Te sientes completamente ahogado por la situaci\xF3n, \xBFverdad? Entiendo
    como te sientes y, aunque no conozco la situaci\xF3n con tus padres, creo que
    una parte de ti busca a alguien a quien culpar de la situaci\xF3n."
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 1764620523}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
